---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'

// Who answers privacy requests. Same contact as the other Irchiinnuss sites.
const CONTROLLER = 'Irchiinnuss'
const CONTACT_EMAIL = 'hello@irchiinnuss.com'
const UPDATED = 'September 11, 2026'
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Notice — Lumen Apeiron"
  description="How Lumen Apeiron handles the small amount of data it touches: no accounts, no ads, and flames that stay on your device unless you share them."
>
  <main class="wrap legal-shell" id="main">
    <article class="legal">
      <a class="legal__back" href="/">&larr; Back to Lumen Apeiron</a>
      <p class="legal__label">Plain-language privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: {UPDATED}</p>

      <p class="legal__lead">
        Lumen Apeiron is a fractal flame editor that renders on your device's
        GPU. This notice covers the web app at <strong>lumenapeiron.com</strong
        >, this site at <strong>about.lumenapeiron.com</strong>, and the Lumen
        Apeiron apps for iPhone, iPad and Android. There are no accounts, and
        the flames you make stay on your device unless you choose to share them.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Your work.</strong> Flames, sessions, your variation library
            and settings are saved in your browser's storage, or in the app's own
            storage on your phone or tablet. We never receive them unless you
            share a flame. Clearing site data or uninstalling the app deletes
            them, so use the backup export if you want a copy.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Microphone.</strong> Audio-reactive mode listens only while
            you have it switched on. The sound is analysed on your device and is
            never sent to us.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What we handle</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Share links.</strong> When you create a share link, the flame
            you are sharing (its parameters, its name, and any custom variation
            code in it) is stored with Cloudflare so the link can be opened. The
            stored flame expires after 60 days. A preview image and title may be
            kept so the link shows a preview when it is posted elsewhere.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Sharing to Discord (web app only).</strong> If you post a
            flame to our Discord community, the image, its title and the name you
            enter are sent to our Discord server. Cloudflare Turnstile checks that
            the request comes from a person; see Cloudflare's{' '}
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/"
              >Turnstile Privacy Notice</a
            >. If you also choose to suggest the flame for the home gallery, we
            store the flame, image, title and name for review, and publish it
            only after a person has approved it.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Analytics (websites only).</strong> The web app and this site
            use Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which features are
            used. The web app removes the query part of the address before a page
            view is sent, so share links and their contents never reach Google.
            See{' '}
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's Privacy Policy</a
            >. <strong>The iPhone, iPad and Android apps contain no analytics.</strong
            >
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Operation and abuse protection.</strong> Cloudflare serves the
            sites and the sharing service, and processes standard request data
            such as IP addresses and security logs to do so. Short-lived rate
            limits keyed to the requesting IP address protect sharing from spam.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>In-app purchases (apps).</strong> Purchases are processed by
            Apple or Google; we never see your payment details. We use RevenueCat
            to confirm what you bought. It receives an anonymous app identifier
            and your purchase history, not your name or email; see{' '}
            <a href="https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy/">RevenueCat's Privacy Policy</a
            >.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Why we use it</h2>
        <p>
          Share links, Discord posts and gallery suggestions exist because you
          ask for them; we process that data to provide the feature you
          requested. Hosting, security and rate limits rely on our legitimate
          interest in keeping the service available and free of abuse.
          Analytics rely on our legitimate interest in understanding how the
          product is used; you can object at any time by contacting us, or block
          it with your browser's tracking protection or Google's opt-out add-on.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not sell personal data, show ads, or track you across other
          companies' apps and websites.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Retention and your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Stored share links expire after 60 days. Discord posts stay on Discord
          until they are deleted, and gallery suggestions stay until they are
          declined or removed. Event-level analytics data is kept for at most 14
          months. If you want a share link, preview or gallery entry removed
          sooner, send us the link.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are in the EU or EEA, you may ask to access, correct, erase,
          restrict, object to, or receive a copy of personal data we hold about
          you. You may also complain to your local supervisory authority; in
          Croatia that is{' '}
          <abbr title="Agencija za zaštitu osobnih podataka">AZOP</abbr>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Lumen Apeiron is operated by {CONTROLLER} (Croatia), the data
          controller for the data described above. Questions or requests:{' '}
          <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We will
          update the date at the top when this notice changes.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-shell {
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem) clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .legal {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal__back {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal__label,
  .legal__updated {
    color: var(--solar);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal h1 {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.4rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--neutral-50);
  }

  .legal__updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--neutral-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .legal__lead {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--neutral-300);
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .legal section {
    padding-block: 0;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    color: var(--neutral-100);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--neutral-400);
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .legal ul {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal li + li {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .legal strong {
    color: var(--neutral-100);
  }

  .legal section a {
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
